# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. This template IS committed; .env is NOT.
#
# The project's own LLM key. Deliberately NOT named ANTHROPIC_API_KEY:
# if ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set in your shell, Claude Code switches to API-key auth,
# which breaks Remote Control, cross-session messaging, and cloud sessions.
# Never set this as a system-wide environment variable; it lives only in .env.
APP_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Stage 6 (tracing), added then:
# LANGSMITH_TRACING=true
# LANGSMITH_API_KEY=

# Stage 8 (Microsoft Foundry), added then:
# ANTHROPIC_FOUNDRY_RESOURCE=
# AZURE_FOUNDRY_API_KEY=
